WEBVTT

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.900
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:15.490
<i>Gomamon.</i>

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:17.860
<i>This Digimon is Joe-san's partner.</i>

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:17.860
LEVEL: ROOKIE

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:20.530
TYPE: SEA ANIMAL

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:22.950
<i>Gomamon's beautiful white fur can regulate
body temperature even underwater.</i>

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:23.240
SPECIAL MOVE: MARCHING FISHES

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.620
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>The fishes that appear
in the Marching Fishes move</i>

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.040
<i>are said to be Gomamon's followers.</i>

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:35.010
<i>But are they always standing by?
How dedicated!</i>

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.220
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:48.230
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:48.230
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:54.320
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:54.320
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.080
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.080
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:21.300
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:21.300
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:26.470
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:26.470
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.900
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:37.690
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:37.690
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.570
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:42.570
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.790
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.790
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:52.670
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:52.670
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:58.460
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:58.460
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:04.300
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:04.300
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:13.110
<i>As Taichi's party moved
through the maze-like canyon,</i>

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:18.610
<i>Ultimate Digimon Oukuwamon leading a swarm
of Kuwagamon was lying in wait.</i>

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:26.070
<i>Koshiro was perplexed
by his tablet not working,</i>

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:30.210
<i>but he returned to his calm self
thanks to Kabuterimon's words.</i>

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:35.420
<i>And he managed to turn the tables
with an idea of his own.</i>

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:38.380
<i>A path to counter the enemy was opened.</i>

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:50.180
<i>And so, Kabuterimon super evolved
into Ultimate Digimon Atlurkabuterimon</i>

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:54.980
<i>and successfully defeated Oukuwamon.</i>

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:08.890
Around here might be good.

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:10.120
Birdramon.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:11.120
Okay.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.600
I'm going to rest a little.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:21.970
You did fly the whole way here.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.880
Thank you, Piyomon.

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:26.180
Finally, a break...

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.970
Joe, you did good too. Well done!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:33.520
The rendezvous point
with Yagami's group isn't so far now.

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:35.730
The terrain up ahead is...

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.990
Hmm, there's a really big river.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:42.740
I don't think we can swim across it.

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:45.620
Then that's where Gomamon comes in.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.070
Roger! Leave it to me!

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:50.410
First, to cross this mountain...

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:53.000
Yeah, I'll take everyone!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.170
Thank you!

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.250
Piyomon, get lots of rest.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:59.840
Okay. Once we cross the river,
we'll fly straight there!

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.970
They said my turn's coming up.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.130
I guess we're crossing the river.

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:08.930
By the way, those two are completely
in charge of strategizing now...

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.230
Joe, you just have to sit back
and look important.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:16.060
That's true! I am the leader after all!

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.520
Yeah! That's right!

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.600
Oh?

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:26.780
Footsteps?!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.840
ZUDOMON'S IRON HAMMER OF LIGHTNING

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.300
What is this huge thing?!

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.850
That's Mammon!

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.430
An Ultimate Digimon!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.890
MAMMON

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.970
And those are Yukidarumon!

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:54.600
Here they come!

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:59.310
Watch out!

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:08.900
Sora!

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:12.410
YUKIDARUMON

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:12.410
Piyomon!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:19.750
Sora-kun?!

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:20.750
Sora!

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:23.170
Marching Fishes!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:28.840
What is this?!

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:29.890
Sora!

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:31.390
It's spreading?!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:32.850
Gabumon!

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:33.760
Okay!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.400
This is...

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:45.690
Sora!

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.440
W-What is it?!

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:02.210
What's going on...

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.260
An avalanche!

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:18.600
Gabumon!

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.190
No! We won't make...

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.530
Whoa!

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:34.370
This is another crazy place!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.330
There's nothing here.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:39.460
So, which way are we supposed to go?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.960
I'm looking it up right now. Umm...

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:46.170
What is it?

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.010
Somebody do something!

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:50.170
Wahh! Stop right now!

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.170
KIWIMON

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:51.510
What?!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:52.890
A herd of Kiwimon!

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:55.390
Why are you riding one, Mimi?!

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.930
They were cute, so I wanted to ride one!

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.930
I said stop!

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:04.690
But we're going the right way.

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:07.980
That's not important now!

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.490
Looks like we lost them.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.450
That was close!

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:21.000
<i>Thanks for saving us, Garurumon!</i>

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.210
<i>Sure.</i>

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.580
More importantly...

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:24.590
Sora...

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:28.210
The ice on her leg
from Yukidarumon's attack is still there.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:30.670
Isn't it gradually spreading?!

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:35.350
If you don't completely melt it,
it'll keep spreading over and over...

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.600
An ice... virus?!

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:40.430
Yeah. We need to hurry and melt it.

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:43.100
Don't worry, this is nothin...

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.600
Sora!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.360
Then... with my fire!

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.320
Piyomon.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:55.030
Don't be rash. That'll only hurt Sora.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:57.950
Even making a fire
to warm her up would be risky here.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:01.120
We'll carry her on Garurumon
straight to the bottom.

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.840
There's more of those Yukidarumon...

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:14.090
They're looking for us, thinking we got
swallowed by the avalanche.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:17.010
Someone needs to draw them away.

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:18.720
Can you do it?

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.930
Got it! Leave it to Joe!

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.100
What?!

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:38.280
Okay, I'll try.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.240
Yeah!

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:49.370
O-O-O-O-Over here!

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:57.510
Ikkakumon!

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:58.470
Yeah!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.770
That's right, come this way!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.150
Joe, there's more from over there too!

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:11.980
We've lured all
the Yukidarumon now, right?

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.730
Just... Mammon left.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:17.400
There!

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:19.410
Here we go!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:20.660
Okay!

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:23.280
Harpoon Vulcan!

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:31.550
One more!

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:33.090
Okay!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:44.270
Here they come!

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:45.980
Hello? Hello?!

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.520
Uh, this is Kido!

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.060
We've lured Mammon and Yukidarumon away!

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:52.820
Got it, we're leaving too.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.310
Let's go, Garurumon!

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:55.690
All right!

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:04.580
We just head toward the river, right?

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:09.830
Yeah, everyone else is going upstream,
so we'll lure them downstream!

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:11.460
Got it!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:14.340
Joe, grab on!

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:15.380
Huh?

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:22.970
A crevasse!

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.100
H-How's that for you?!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.860
What?!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:51.620
That's impossible!

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:03.640
We somehow made it.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:04.560
Yeah.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:05.930
We should be fine now.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.480
That was terrible.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:13.020
There's all sorts of Digimon,
so you shouldn't casually play with them.

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:14.190
Okay.

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:17.860
Huh?

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.150
What's wrong?

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:22.870
There's wind coming from inside this cave.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:24.150
Say what?

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:28.290
If there's wind blowing this way,

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:31.160
does that mean this leads somewhere?

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:37.170
This seems a little odd...

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.760
Can't you slide faster?!

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:48.970
No, there's too many trees!

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:53.390
Ahh, they're here!

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:57.560
We've come down pretty far!
Don't you see the river yet?!

00:11:58.060 --> 00:12:01.360
Not yet! Joe, hang on tight!

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:03.820
It's no use! They're gonna catch up!

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:20.010
They're coming from above the cliff too!

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:21.710
They're gonna get us!

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.880
Good! We're saved!

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.390
They're slowing down!

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:31.140
Joe, hang on!

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:32.180
Huh?

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:44.030
That was close...

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:45.410
Huh?!

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:51.200
So we were being herded here?!

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:53.540
What do we do, Joe?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:57.290
"What do we do?"
I'm not in charge of strategy...

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:05.420
It's no use!
We can't win against that huge thing!

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:10.590
Remember our role, Joe!

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:13.970
<i>Our role is...</i>

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:18.850
<i>to draw them away to save Sora-kun...</i>

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:21.610
Let's do it... Joe!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.360
Let's do what we need to do!

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:27.070
That's right!

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:29.990
We just have to stop them.

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:33.080
Stop... Step...

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:38.290
That's it!

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:42.540
Ikkakumon, aim for the spot
where Mammon's going to step!

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:44.300
Roger that!

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.300
Now!

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:01.940
Yes!

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:06.450
Huh?

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:08.570
W-Wait a minute...

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:28.710
Ow... Joe, you okay?

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:30.680
Somehow...

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.220
Wait, huh?!

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:33.980
It's the river!

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:35.350
We made it.

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:40.600
That was amazing, Joe!
We got away in that situation!

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:44.190
This was all part of my plan!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:51.990
How persistent!

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.410
Was this part of your plan too?!

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:56.990
Just hurry and cross the river!

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:09.670
All right! We were able to
stall them somehow!

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:14.090
We should be fine now!

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.810
Hello? How's the situation over there?

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:21.560
We've already crossed the river.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:24.570
<i>How's Sora-kun?!</i>

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:26.810
She's next to the fire right now.

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.070
The ice should melt soon.

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:33.870
Thank goodness!
We're crossing the river right now.

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:35.540
We've shaken them off too!

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:40.080
<i>You should be able to see the smoke
on the opposite bank. We'll be under it.</i>

00:15:40.490 --> 00:15:41.830
Oh! That's it!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.830
Okay, Ikkakumon, full speed ahead!

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:49.090
What is it?!

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:04.940
The river water's freezing?!

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:08.730
Oh, no! We'll be turned into ice too!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.190
Hurry!

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:19.370
Ow! Ow, ow, ow....

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:20.200
Oh!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.080
What?!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.420
N-No way...

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:29.630
<i>Did something happen?</i>

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:31.920
Th-They're coming!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:43.060
Joe!

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:49.770
Joe, let's fight!

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:53.110
We can't let them cross this bridge!

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:54.990
Ikkakumon...

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:56.360
But...

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:08.340
Ikkakumon! That's too reckless.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:10.250
Not with just the two of us...

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:12.970
Sora can't move yet.

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:16.170
If they get past us,
everyone will be in danger!

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.100
Sora-kun...

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:28.640
Let's protect everyone by ourselves, Joe!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:30.730
I'll...

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:32.980
<i>Protect...</i>

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:36.740
<i>This is Yamato.</i>

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:39.860
<i>Is something wrong?
I'll head over if things seem bad.</i>

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:43.700
No.

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:46.830
Don't worry. There's no problem.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:50.590
<i>Right now, Sora-kun can't be left alone.</i>

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.880
<i>Please stay with her!</i>

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.470
Let's do it, Ikkakumon!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.850
We'll make sure to stop them here!

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:06.600
That's the spirit!

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:17.230
Ikkakumon!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.910
Ikkakumon...

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:26.870
Super Evolution!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.630
Zudomon!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:38.010
ZUDOMON

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.510
Zudomon!

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:40.480
Hammer...

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:44.240
Spark!

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:59.380
Zudomon...

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:13.350
<i>It is now the third morning
of the power loss.</i>

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:17.190
<i>As emergency powers begin to turn on,</i>

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:22.030
<i>only electronic devices connected online
remain to mysteriously operate.</i>

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:28.120
<i>All disaster information is updated
on each region's official websites.</i>

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:28.910
<i>"So many people."</i>

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:31.540
<i>The government recommends
all citizens to carry a device</i>

00:20:29.030 --> 00:20:31.080
<i>"He's sleeping."</i>

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.410
<i>"Took this earlier."</i>

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:34.000
<i>to stay connected online at all times.</i>

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:34.410
<i>"#TrainTrackChallenge"</i>

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:39.750
Piyomon Evolution!

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:41.670
Birdramon!

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.050
I'm glad you're better now!

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:44.930
Yeah!

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:48.180
Thank you!
It's all thanks to you and Gomamon.

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:54.270
Well, I only did
what's expected as the leader!

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:56.940
C'mon, everyone!

00:20:57.350 --> 00:20:59.570
I can fly any time now.

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:01.440
Let's set out soon.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.990
Now then, will the leader give
the word of command?

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.450
All right, everyone...

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:07.370
Let's go.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.240
Yeah!

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:10.950
What? How come?!

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:22.840
Hey...

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:26.760
Isn't this cave kind of weird?

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:30.060
Yeah, even though
it's hard to tell in the dark,

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:33.180
it doesn't feel like a cave in here.

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:36.020
The walls and ground
are all slippery as if...

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:36.900
Taichi!

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:37.860
Huh?

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.310
-It's the exit!
-What?!

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:15.720
<i>naze ima kono te to te nigitte</i>

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:15.770
<i>Why do these held hands</i>

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:18.440
<i>And the warmth exchanged</i>

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:18.390
<i>tashikameta taion wo</i>

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:20.850
<i>Make me reminisce now</i>

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:20.850
<i>natsukashiku omou noka</i>

00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:26.440
<i>naze samidare no susabu shinen</i>

00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:26.490
<i>Why an abyss dancing with endless rain</i>

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:29.030
<i>The gaze of that smile</i>

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:28.940
<i>hohoenda sono shisen ni</i>

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:30.370
<i>Makes me want to cry</i>

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:30.320
<i>nakitaku naru</i>

00:22:30.370 --> 00:22:33.240
<i>So call me with that voice</i>

00:22:30.450 --> 00:22:33.240
<i>sono koe de boku wo yonde kure</i>

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:35.450
<i>This weakness I cannot tell others</i>

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:35.410
<i>dare ni ienu kono yowasa ga</i>

00:22:35.450 --> 00:22:38.540
<i>I realize is my pillar to stand firm</i>

00:22:35.530 --> 00:22:38.500
<i>tsuyoku tatsu tame no jiku dato omoishiru</i>

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:40.830
<i>Difference is what makes me adore you</i>

00:22:38.620 --> 00:22:40.790
<i>chigau kara itooshiku naru</i>

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:43.800
<i>I just want to understand you and me</i>

00:22:40.910 --> 00:22:43.750
<i>tada wakaritai kimi to boku wo</i>

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:46.010
<i>Scars grow the more we live</i>

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:45.960
<i>ikiru hodo kizu ga fuete iku</i>

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:49.260
<i>But still we seek the reasons for us</i>

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:49.210
<i>sore demo sagashiteiru bokura no wake wo</i>

00:22:49.260 --> 00:22:51.510
<i>Overlaying them makes us beautiful</i>

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:51.470
<i>kasanete wa utsukushiku naru</i>

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.390
<i>I want to know now, I want to cry out</i>

00:22:51.590 --> 00:22:55.390
<i>ima wakaritai sakebi dashitai</i>

00:23:01.850 --> 00:23:04.480
<i>With creepy Digimon
behind the scenes of Tokyo,</i>

00:23:04.730 --> 00:23:07.440
<i>Taichi's team learns a shocking truth.</i>

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:11.990
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Jet-Black Shadow Invades Tokyo"</i>

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:14.700
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>

00:23:16.740 --> 00:23:18.740
<i></i>
